# Runesword's ability on Bot1's attacking Grizzly Bears, blocked by Drudge Skeletons with a regeneration shield: the Bears
# get +2/+0 until end of turn only, for exactly {3}; a creature that is not attacking can't be the target. The Bears' 4
# damage destroys the Skeletons, which can't be regenerated (CR 701.19c, 611.2c) and would die, so they are exiled instead
# (CR 614.1a, 700.4). The Bears survive, so Runesword stays, and their dying on a later turn does not sacrifice it ("this
# turn").
